{"id": "14442243398", "title": "Repeated order cancellation without reasons", "content": "Myntra, this is extremely frustrating and honestly unacceptable.\n\nYour app keeps cancelling my orders without any prior information or even a phone call. Four of my orders have been cancelled to date, and not once have I received a proper call before the cancellation.\n\nWhat exactly does “cancelled under some circumstances” mean? If there is an issue with the order, inventory, delivery, or anything else, the customer deserves to be informed clearly before you cancel it. This is not a fair way to treat customers, especially from a brand like Myntra.\n\nThank God I don’t usually make prepaid orders on this app, because after this experience, I have very little confidence that my order will actually be delivered.\n\nPlease look into this issue seriously and provide a proper explanation for these repeated cancellations. This experience is extremely disappointing and unacceptable.", "rating": "1", "userName": "Akankshanegii", "updated": "2026-08-18T03:22:44-07:00", "source": "app_store", "app_id": "907394059", "_origin": "itunes_rss", "_fetched_at": "2026-08-19T18:50:40.314789+00:00"}
